cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this software together with the accompanying article."
title: "Deep sequence models for next-event magnitude prediction in the Zagros-Makran transition zone: benchmark pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline for a controlled benchmark of four deep sequence architectures
  (LSTM, GRU, TCN, Transformer) against statistical and catalog-derived
  baselines for next-event magnitude prediction, including catalog
  construction, completeness and b-value estimation, parameter-matched
  training, ETAS fitting, moving-block bootstrap and circular-shift inference,
  and Integrated Gradients attribution.
type: software
